/P 218 0 R
/E (While Poipet remains deeply important to Project Battambang, current safety concerns have required the team to reconsider where and how the project can continue responsibly. The decision to explore new sites was not made lightly. It reflects a commitment to safeguarding our members, respecting institutional guidance, and ensuring that our work remains sustainable and appropriate.)
