/P 227 0 R
/E (Located within Phnom Penh, the area has long been associated with urban poverty and vulnerable communities, particularly due to its historical links to landfill-adjacent settlements. )
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
487 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 227 0 R
/E (As Project Battambang considered possible new directions, Stung Meanchey was identified as a site where there may be existing gaps in healthcare, education and social support. The team thus sought to better understand the lived realities of residents and assess whether our project could meaningfully complement the work already being done on the ground.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
