/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 231 0 R
/E (Education was highly valued within the community, with many residents expressing aspirations for higher levels of study. However, financial constraints remained a major barrier to continued education. This revealed a gap between educational aspirations and the resources needed to achieve them. These findings suggest that future education-related initiatives could focus on improving awareness of educational opportunities, reducing barriers to continued learning and supporting students in navigating available pathways.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
