/E (Stung Meanchey presents clear areas of need, particularly in health education, preventive care and education support. However, future involvement should be carefully considered in relation to existing organisations already working in the area. Project Battambang should only pursue initiatives that complement current support systems and address gaps that local partners identify as meaningful.)
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [3]
>>
