/E (Koh Dach Island appears to present potential for future Project Battambang initiatives, particularly if supported by local partners and community leaders. The positive attitude towards screening and follow-up care suggests possible community receptiveness. However, future plans must account for transport limitations, treatment costs, subsidy coverage and referral pathways. Any initiative should be designed with local stakeholders to ensure that it is accessible, sustainable and responsive to actual community needs.)
/Pg 28 0 R
/K [3]
>>
