/E (Apart from conducting door-to-door surveys, the Development Subcommittee also prioritised engaging with village chiefs. These visits were invaluable in providing deeper insights into community needs and establishing relationships that may facilitate future collaborations. While we were unable to meet the village chief of Stung Meanchey, our team met with two village chiefs on Koh Dach Island, gaining a better understanding of the challenges they face in leading their communities and the forms of support they consider most beneficial.)
