/E (While Green Bethel School provided valuable insight into the educational landscape in Stung Meanchey, the team has decided not to pursue a formal collaboration with the school for future trips. Through our conversation, we learnt that Green Bethel School is already supported by several NGOs and external partners. Their current priorities are also centred on long-term financial and developmental support, which would require a level of sustained engagement beyond what Project Battambang can provide through biannual trips.)
/Pg 38 0 R
