/E (Despite the demands of his final year, Rady continues to balance his studies with a part-time job to support his living expenses and travel costs. His schedule is tiring, but he spoke with a quiet sense of purpose that stayed with us. What stood out most was his desire to give back to Poipet. In his own capacity, he has started providing free Mathematics tuition for students at Mother of Peace Kindergarten, supporting younger students who are walking a path similar to his own.)
/Pg 41 0 R
/K [0]
