/E (To improve consistency and objectivity, scholars will be assessed using a set of predetermined criteria. Standardised information will also be collected from each selected scholar, including their background, school and grade level, financial needs, interests and aspirations. These details will be compiled into individual student profiles, allowing donors to better understand the students they are supporting.)
/Pg 43 0 R
