/E (One key takeaway for the Education Committee was the importance of flexibility when building school partnerships. While pre-trip planning gave us a starting point, our conversations on the ground showed that each school had different priorities, limitations and expectations. This reminded us that education initiatives cannot be planned in isolation. They must be shaped through continued dialogue with the schools we hope to support.)
/Pg 44 0 R
/K [2]
