695 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 259 0 R
/E (During the May 2026 recce trip, NGO visits played an important role in helping Project Battambang explore its future direction beyond Poipet. As the project considered entering new communities, it was essential for us to first understand the existing support systems, community needs and local organisations already working on the ground.)
/Pg 53 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
696 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 259 0 R
/E <>
/Pg 53 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
697 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 259 0 R
/E (Through these visits, the team gained a deeper appreciation of the complexity of community work in Cambodia. We also learnt the importance of complementing, rather than duplicating, existing efforts. In some instances, the team recognised that a formal collaboration may not be appropriate if our involvement would not add value to the community. Overall, these NGO visits shaped our understanding of sustainable partnership-building and reminded us of the importance of humility, intentionality and respect for local expertise as Project Battambang enters its next chapter.)
/Pg 53 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
