/Title (Over half of surveyed households had school-going children, and many residents expressed aspirations for university-level education. This reflects strong community support for education. However, economic constraints remained a significant barrier to educational attainment. These findings suggest that education-related initiatives may be relevant on Koh Dach, particularly those that improve awareness, access and opportunities for continued learning. School-based engagement may also be a feasible avenue for future collaboration.)
/Dest [27 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 5462 0 R
/Next 5470 0 R
>>
