5470 0 obj
<<
/Title (Residents demonstrated a highly positive attitude towards health screening and follow-up care. This suggests that future screening programmes may achieve strong participation and community engagement. While most respondents were willing to travel reasonable distances for screening, concerns regarding treatment costs, transportation and limited healthcare subsidy coverage remain important considerations. These findings highlight the need for accessible screening locations, clear referral pathways and practical follow-up plans.)
/Dest [27 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 5462 0 R
/Prev 5466 0 R
/Next 5474 0 R
>>
