/Title (The community reported a burden of both acute and chronic health conditions. Common concerns included musculoskeletal pain, hypertension and diabetes. Drinking water sources were also raised as an area of concern. These findings suggest potential value in targeted health screening and education initiatives. Future programmes could focus on non-communicable diseases, preventive healthcare, musculoskeletal health, water safety and general health literacy.)
/Dest [27 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 5462 0 R
/Prev 5470 0 R
/Next 5475 0 R
