5496 0 obj
<<
/Title (During the May 2026 trip, the Education Committee engaged several schools to better understand their needs and identify areas where Project Battambang could complement existing programmes. As the project explored a new direction beyond Poipet, these visits were important in helping the team assess the educational landscape in Stung Meanchey and Koh Dach. They also allowed us to consider how future initiatives could support students and teachers in practical areas such as health, hygiene, first aid and fitness education.)
/Dest [38 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 5488 0 R
/Next 5501 0 R
>>
